nU0 = Vector((-sin(pt)*cos(h), -sin(pt)*sin(h), cos(pt)))        # Unbanked slope normal\\nR  = cos(bk)*R0 - sin(bk)*U0                                    # Banked +Right across ribbon\\nU  = sin(\n<truncated 633 bytes>\n76..17.560` | `224..422` | `3.0..42.0` | `-0.3..+13.51` | `-4.0..+6.2` | `208.7..318.5` | — |\\n| `sky_bridge` | `0.33..0.50` | `1228..1860` | `17.560..25.139` | `422..604` | `42.0..42.4` | `-0.1..+0.1` | `0.0` | `217.4..318.5` | `bridge=True` (`316` pts / `632 m`) |\\n| `banked_bowl_plunge` | `0.50..0.70` | `1860..2604` | `25.139..37.382` | `604..898` | `1.5..42.0` | `-13.94..+1.0` | `-5.5..+17.4` | `137.4..318.5` | — |\\n| `strobe_tunnel_harbor` | `0.70..1.00` | `2604..3720` | `37.382..53.333` | `898..1281` | `0.8..1.5` | `-0.2..0.0` | `0.0` | `81.1..341.2` | `tunnel=True` for `0.71..0.85` (`261` pts / `520 m`, `f=908..1041`) |\\n\\n### 3. Key Cinematic Landmarks (for Set-Pieces, Impact Frames, 3×4s Clips \\u0026 SFX Drops)\\n- **Canyon Chicane Apex**: `idx=199`, `s=398 m`, `t=5.168 s`, **`f=125`** (`129.5 km/h`)\\n- **Eau-Rouge Bottom Compression (Spark Scrape)**: `idx=392`, `s=784 m`, `t=11.705 s`, **`f=282`** (`318.5 km/h`, `Z=5.67 m`)\\n- **Raidillon Steepest Climb (`+13.51°` Pitch)**: `idx=437`, `s=874 m`, `t=12.817 s`, **`f=309`** (`245.0 km/h`, `Z=22.23 m`, `+6.2°` bank)\\n- **Eau-Rouge `+42 m` Blind Crest (Horizon Moon / Impact #1)**: `idx=599`, `s=1198 m`, `t=17.220 s`, **`f=414`** (`318.5 km/h`, `Z=42.00 m`)\\n- **`188°` Carousel Bowl `+17.4°` Banked Apex**: `idx=974`, `s=1948 m`, `t=26.410 s`, **`f=635`** (`188.2 km/h`, `Z=42.00 m`)\\n- **Corkscrew Steepest S-Plunge (`-13.94°` Pitch)**: `idx=1189`, `s=2378 m`, `t=34.526 s`, **`f=830`** (`238.1 km/h`, `Z=20.68 m`)\\n- **Cyber-Strobe Tunnel Span (`tunnel=True`)**: `idx=1321..1581`, `s=2642..3162 m` (`520 m`), `t=37.811..43.326 s`, **`f=908..1041`** (`Z=1.50 m`, top speed **`341.2 km/h` @ `f=933`**, blinding exit `340.2 km/h` @ **`f=1041`**)\\n- **Harbor Hairpin Heavy-Brake Slam (Impact #2